<unit id="61d4a0f8-422a-4e62-b662-b3663a8371a9">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 54</note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>- Changed default shortcut for guessing item order to `NVDA+Control+I` to avoid collision with NVDA built-in gestures.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="36ddbc4f-83c5-4cff-b3e5-bd7ff869f825">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 56</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: ### </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Version 2.0</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="5685a7a6-2729-4c92-bb9d-2506c7c7200c">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 57</note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>- Added interactive filter selection popup menu ("By role" or "All siblings") when guessing item order via `NVDA+Shift+I`.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="39f308c5-5a8d-4970-8709-d4eaa2347b2d">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 58</note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>- Added optimized fast O(1) order calculation for classic MSAA controls (e.g., wxWidgets, Poedit) directly via `NVDA+I`.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="cb6a4fbd-6a0a-402b-be73-7b2cbd4fabee">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 59</note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>- Automatically cancel ongoing background calculations when triggering a new order calculation command.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="994bd74c-e46c-4d78-8d8d-02dc7083c23a">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 60</note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>- Suppressed redundant focus announcements only when selecting a filter menu item (ensuring focus is announced when cancelling the menu via Escape).</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="2fda32ca-ce10-451c-8c42-93f18bf87214">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 61</note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>- Updated Ukrainian localization and documentation.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="efaf54a3-6e91-4fe5-93b9-ba5da5be93d3">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 63</note>
<note appliesTo="source">prefix: ### </note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>Version 1.1</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="dc23ddfd-70ac-4d1a-8d96-2bef2e6a13f4">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 64</note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>- Removed the word "Item" ("Елемент") from announcement messages for a more concise output (e.g., "3 of 10" instead of "Item 3 of 10").</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="0923c940-ac7a-4e0b-852a-78c7b255753d">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 65</note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>- Updated minimum NVDA version to 2024.1 due to Python 3.10+ syntax requirements (older NVDA versions use Python 3.7, while NVDA 2024.1 updated to Python 3.11).</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="8de7630c-d504-4628-b712-f7d80977a175">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 66</note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>- Made fallback item order guessing asynchronous by running calculation in a background thread with periodic audio progress feedback (sound signal) to avoid freezing NVDA during long container traversals.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="7a7b6068-8327-4af6-86b8-8193f8f3ec60">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 67</note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>- Delayed progress audio feedback to prevent unnecessary beeps on fast lists.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="73bc816c-39b1-42ba-8c3d-7299f4f40c96">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 68</note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>- Automatically cancel background item order calculation when focus moves to another object.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
<unit id="bb535c55-4bff-41b7-8e23-0b0656efd284">
<notes>
<note appliesTo="source">line: 69</note>
</notes>
<segment>
<source>- Updated Ukrainian localization and documentation.</source>
</segment>
</unit>
